{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38643","headline":"山居即事二首 一 · 陆希声","name":"山居即事二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君山苍翠接青冥，东走洮湖上洞庭。\n茅屋向阳梳白发，竹窓深夜诵丹经。\n涌泉回泬鱼龙气，怪石惊腾鸟兽形。\n爲问前时金马客，此焉还作少微星。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆希声","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38643.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38643","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}